<h2>Best Time to Visit</h2>
<p>Insadong is most atmospheric on weekend mornings before the crowds build. By midday on weekends the main street gets very busy. If you prefer a quieter experience, visit on a weekday morning. The galleries tend to open around 10am and close around 6–7pm.</p>

<p>The neighborhood hosts various cultural festivals throughout the year — traditional music performances, craft fairs, and seasonal celebrations. Check what's on during your visit.</p>

